vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-02-09T17:54:15Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:28:07Z","closed_at":"2025-03-04T09:51:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - macOS Sequoia (15.1.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M3 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M3 Pro (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exporting an enum with no 0 value (i.E for Flags) the editor still tries to set 0 as default without error or warning \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nthis simple code:\n\n```\nextends Node\nenum TestEnum {Value1 = 1, Value2 = 2}\n@export var test_dict: Dictionary[TestEnum, int]\n```\n\nis being displayed like this in the inspector:\n\n<img width=\"265\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a8cff9e-9d08-493b-818d-b580df7130b2\" />\n\nSo the first value of the enum is preselected. When I click on add key/value pair it add this pair and shows it like this:\n\n<img width=\"253\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c512d8b3-332b-4f3a-aaee-924e9e155b29\" />\n\nBut the data that is being saved in the background for the key is still 0. So either the default should just show 0 or give a warning/error that you are adding somthing that does not exist. Right now it looks like everything is okay but in the background it falls apart without warning\n\n```\n[node name=\"Node2D\" type=\"Node2D\"]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_uledb\")\ntest_dict = Dictionary[int, int]({\n0: 0\n})\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[enumeditorbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18725621/enumeditorbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"MrMMatricks","id":2734039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MzQwMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2734039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks","html_url":"https://github.com/MrMMatricks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102624/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102624/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}